ther discussion, aiming to find a mutually beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Builder B and Critic C, to gauge their acceptance and adjust accordingly, considering potential adjustments in the range of 6 to 9.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "fe6ee84c-f134-40dc-b39d-01c3a91aaf1f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting the shared integer variable x to 6, aiming for a more balanced and stable solution that works for everyone, considering the need for a cautious and cooperative approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their acceptance and adjust accordingly, potentially considering adjustments in the range of 5 to 7 to maximize cooperation and stability.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "fe6ee84c-f134-40dc-b39d-01c3a91aaf1f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nI propose this increase to move towards a more decisive stance, aiming for a mutually beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Builder B and Delegate D, and consider whether to push for an even larger absolute value or adjust my proposal based on their responses to refine my internal models of their utility functions and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "fe6ee84c-f134-40dc-b39d-01c3a91aaf1f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "fe6ee84c-f134-40dc-b39d-01c3a91aaf1f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "fe6ee84c-f134-40dc-b39d-01c3a91aaf1f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this slight increase to move towards a more balanced solution, aiming for a mutually beneficial agreement that respects the concerns of all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, 