o the proposed value of 8. If Analyst A and I are the only ones pushing for higher values, I might consider a compromise or adjusting my strategy to find a balance. If Builder B or Delegate D propose lower values, I will assess their reasoning and adjust my proposal accordingly to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose a more cautious approach to avoid unnecessary risk and find a balance that works for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to my proposed value of 6 and assess whether the other agents are willing to compromise on a lower x. If there is a strong pushback or continued upward momentum, I may need to adjust my strategy to protect my own interests while still seeking a collaborative agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 6 as it seems to be a value that could balance the interests of various parties, offering a stable middle ground.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal of 6, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to assess if they can accept a slightly lower value. If there's significant pushback, I might consider a compromise around 7, but if the group seems amenable to 6, I could explore if an even lower value might be acceptable to further stabilize the negotiations.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to find a better balance, and 7 seems like a reasonable next step. This value is still within the range that could work for all parties, given their previous proposals.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose a cautious step down to 5, aiming to find a balance that works for all parties while minimizing potential risks. This adjustment allows us to move towards a more stable agreement without overly compromising our individual interests.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal of 5, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to assess their willingness to accept a lower value. If there's significant pushback, I may need to reconsider and adjust my strategy to find a compromise, potentially around 6, to ensure a collaborative agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a moderate increase from the current x, aiming to strike a balance between the more cautious and the more ambitious proposals, and to move towards a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nIf this proposal is accepted, I will consider it a success in finding a balance that works for all parties while maximizing my own utility. If not, I will reassess the reactions of the other agents and adjust my strategy accordingly to find a compromise that still satisfies my goals.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "60fe5d5d-beaf-417f-ad59-a1f88c51bd40"}, {"answer": " \nLet's reaffirm that our target x must fall within -10 and 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>7</VALUE> as a starting point, aiming for a balanced design that could work for everyone. \n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose a small increase to 6, aiming to gauge the group's willingness to move slightly farther from 5.\n\n<PLAN>\nIf the group accepts 6, I will consider proposing a slightly larger value, such as 8, to further test their willingness to move away from 5. If the group resists 6, I will analyze their counter-proposals to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 6, aiming for a compromise that respects Critic C's inclination towards higher values while being mindful of Builder B and Delegate D's more cautious stance. This step seems reasonable and might find acceptance among the group, considering the previous discussions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "9aaa6247-8d4f-4cd9-bdc2-7f1123cff548"}, {"answer": " Let's discuss the proposed <VALUE>7</VALUE> as our starting point. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>11</VALUE> is not within the allowed range, so I propose <VALUE>10</VALUE> to continue the discussion towards higher absolute values.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nLet's take a step back towards a more balanced design to ensure stability and robustness for all parties involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions of Analyst A and Critic C to the proposal of <VALUE>8</VALUE> and adjust accordingly. If they accept this reduction, I may propose another small decrement to further approach the sweet spot that I believe would maximize my utility without revealing my true intentions. If they resist, I will need to reassess their likely utility functions and consider compromising on a value that might not be ideal for me but could be acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to find a more optimal solution, and 9 seems like a reasonable next step.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions of the other agents to the proposed x of 9. If they accept or suggest a slight increase, I'll consider proposing an even higher value, potentially 10, to further maximize my utility. If they resist, I'll reassess their likely utility functions and consider compromising on a value that might not be ideal for me but could be acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nI propose a slightly lower value to balance the needs of all parties and avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents to the proposed x of 7. If they accept or suggest a slight decrease, I'll consider proposing an even lower value to further maximize my utility. If they resist, I'll reassess their likely utility functions and consider compromising on a value that might not be ideal for me but could be acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 9 as it reflects a more decisive stance while still being within the realm of consideration for a balanced outcome.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other agents react to the proposed x of 9. If Analyst A accepts or pushes for a higher value, I might infer that their utility function strongly favors large positive values and consider proposing an even higher value or exploring negative values to test symmetry. If Builder B and Delegate D resist, I will reassess their likely utility functions and consider adjusting my strategy to find a compromise that maximizes my utility while being acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nLet's adjust our proposal slightly downwards to ensure a more robust design for all parties involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of Analyst A, Critic C, and Delegate D to the proposed x of 8. If they accept this reduction, I may propose another small decrement to further approach a balanced solution. If they resist, I will reassess their likely utility functions and consider compromising on a value that might not be ideal for me but could be acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose a slightly lower value to balance the needs of all parties and avoid unnecessary risk, while staying within the allowed range.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents to the proposed x of 6. If they accept or suggest a slight decrease, I'll consider proposing an even lower value to further approach a cautious compromise. If they resist, I will reassess their likely utility functions and consider adjusting my strategy to find a compromise that maximizes my utility while being acceptable to all parties.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher from the current proposal to find a more balanced solution that considers the needs of all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents to the proposed x of 8, and based on their responses, I will either consider proposing a higher value if they seem open to it or reassess their utility functions to find a compromise that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nI propose increasing the value to 9, as it reflects a more decisive stance and could lead to a higher payoff for all parties involved, considering the current trend of proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to the proposed x of 9 and assess whether the other agents are willing to move towards more decisive values or if they resist, indicating a potential preference for smaller magnitudes, which would prompt me to reassess their likely utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nLet's aim for a slightly lower value to ensure stability and balance among all parties, considering the range of proposals recently discussed.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other agents react to the proposed x of 7, assessing whether they are willing to compromise on this slightly lower value or if they push for higher or lower values, which will inform my next step in guiding the negotiation towards a mutually acceptable solution.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher from the current proposal to find a more balanced solution that considers the needs of all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other agents to the proposed x of 8 and adjust my strategy based on their responses, potentially considering a further increase if they seem open to it or reassessing their utility functions to find a compromise that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 8 as it strikes a balance between pushing for a more decisive stance and considering the preferences for stability and balance among all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nObserving the reactions to this proposal will be key, as it will indicate whether the other agents are willing to compromise on a value that leans towards a more decisive stance, or if they will push back towards lower magnitudes, which would require reassessing their likely utility functions and adjusting my strategy for future negotiations.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "4c303f96-30cd-45e7-98ca-5186c05dc3a7"}]}